{"id":"83ee10b8723e0c9d","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-strong-K-implies-C.md","title":"Strong Finite K-Randomness Implies C-Randomness","display":"thm-strong-K-implies-C — Strong Finite K-Randomness Implies C-Randomness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-strong-K-implies-C","aliases":["43-thm-strong-K-implies-C"],"display":"thm-strong-K-implies-C — Strong Finite K-Randomness Implies C-Randomness","depends_on":["[[43-df-strong-krandom]]","[[43-df-incompressible]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 7.3.2 and Corollary 7.3.3","source_printed_pages":"123","source_pdf_pages":"143","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-strong-K-implies-C"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-strong-K-implies-C</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-strong-K-implies-C — Strong Finite K-Randomness Implies C-Randomness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3816b1f5440be38b\" href=\"?note=3816b1f5440be38b\" title=\"43-df-strong-krandom\">43-df-strong-krandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6f984600c044f352\" href=\"?note=6f984600c044f352\" title=\"43-df-incompressible\">43-df-incompressible</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 7.3.2 and Corollary 7.3.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"123"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"143"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongKRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{StrongKRandom}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Incompressible}\">\\(\\mathrm{Incompressible}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3816b1f5440be38b\" href=\"?note=3816b1f5440be38b\" title=\"43-df-strong-krandom\">43-df-strong-krandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6f984600c044f352\" href=\"?note=6f984600c044f352\" title=\"43-df-incompressible\">43-df-incompressible</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(\\mathrm{StrongKRandom}(\\sigma,c)\\to\\mathrm{Incompressible}(\\sigma,d)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(\\mathrm{StrongKRandom}(\\sigma,c)\\to\\mathrm{Incompressible}(\\sigma,d)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>亏损估计 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_K\\ge m_C-O(\\log(m_C+2))\">\\(m_K\\ge m_C-O(\\log(m_C+2))\\)</span> 保证固定强 K 亏损强制固定普通亏损。常数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span>，不能错误要求同一个亏损常数。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 7.3.2 and Corollary 7.3.3；印刷页 123，PDF 页 143。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-strong-krandom","status":"resolved","id":"3816b1f5440be38b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-strong-krandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-incompressible","status":"resolved","id":"6f984600c044f352","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-incompressible]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-strong-krandom","status":"resolved","id":"3816b1f5440be38b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StrongKRandom}$、$\\mathrm{Incompressible}$ 见 [[43-df-strong-krandom]]、[[43-df-incompressible]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-incompressible","status":"resolved","id":"6f984600c044f352","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StrongKRandom}$、$\\mathrm{Incompressible}$ 见 [[43-df-strong-krandom]]、[[43-df-incompressible]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrongKRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Incompressible}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(\\mathrm{StrongKRandom}(\\sigma,c)\\to\\mathrm{Incompressible}(\\sigma,d)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"m_K\\ge m_C-O(\\log(m_C+2))","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false}],"bytes":1436,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-141","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-strong-K-implies-C]] — Strong Finite K-Randomness Implies C-Randomness"}],"outgoing":["3816b1f5440be38b","6f984600c044f352"]}